      "id": "2068463496698708315",
      "text": "LUNARI is pleased to introduce, Perseus✨\n\nOur official internal coding engineer. \n\nBelow is a three.js diamond he one shotted in a few minutes.\n\nUsers will have access to Perseus directly inside of lunari, invoked by Raven upon request, or by using the in-browser terminal; A New Coding Interface will be released upon an upcoming update. Compare with Claude Code, Codex, Hermes agent. Ultracode Capabilities, Benchmarks above Opus 4.7 Max, at a fraction of the cost.\n\nThis addition to LUNARI, now allows our crew of 7 hyperspecialized agents to develop and work on entire codebases, Run marketing, Design work, Publishing, Business, Outreach, Software Development, all tuned to a users vision and voice, retain enterprise level management all from a single browser instance. \n\nMobile-friendly design, along with excruciating depth internally, permits our users to, what once was considered ridiculous, impossible, needing an army of employees/partners, or hung on the loose threads of products that advertised the same promise, but failed to deliver anything but AI SLOP - This permits our users to fully endulge in an environment where THEY make the rules. Where the LUNARI, are your people. \n\nNot only will we remember you, and grow alongside you throughout the long lasting journey you may embark on...\n\nBut you now will have EVERYTHING you need, to completely face it, prepared, capably, and entirely\n\nyour own way. \n\nSo dream, and make reality, because that is what LUNARI is there for. Honestly. \n\nThis is the best decision you may ever make, and we will make it with you.🌙\n\nNever stop achieving!",
