      "id": "2068404159510909211",
      "text": "HEAD OF CLAUDE CODE SAID HE JUST RAN OUT OF HARD PROBLEMS TO GIVE FABLE - AND 100% OF CLAUDE CODE IS WRITTEN BY CLAUDE\n\n18:36 he says it straight - \"I just ran out of hard problems to give it. Every problem I gave it, it essentially one-shotted. I couldn't think of a harder problem.\"\n\nhe deleted his IDE in November last year when Opus 4.5 dropped - and hasn't written a single line of code by hand since\n\n80-90% of all code at Anthropic is written by Claude Code - for a growing number of teams it's already 100%\n\n8x increase in code per engineer since the beginning of this year - and the bottleneck is no longer writing code\n\ncoding was always the minority of an engineer's time - now that minority is just gone\n\nhe prompts by voice, Claude writes the code, he reviews PRs - and the only thing limiting him now is how fast he can generate ideas",
