    {
      "id": "2068341099849207946",
      "text": "Muhammad here is running your ads.\nClaude is scripting your ads and building your landing page.\nMy brother we can tell\nCongrats you one-shotted your tokens man. Very cool.\nBuilt a landing page that will never convert.\nAnd will proceed to launch that campaign that benefits no one but the tech billionaires\nPeople do fk all with their ads\nAnd wonder why they don't get good results\nI'm auditing this guy's campaign and and the guy literally looks sleepy in the ads while talking about how anyone can make money in 3-5 minutes a day\nThe landing page was purely written and built by AI\nWell no shit, that's why he had thousands of broke leads in his CRM\nAnd to expand the problem\nHe already started hiring a sales team to dial all the shitty leads\nBecause \"yeah there's a ton of leads in here there must be some money we make from them\"\nTotal waste of time.\nYou need good ads.\nAI is not good at making good ads, or anything marketing related.\nIt's good at taking good stuff and then making better stuff with it\nPut more attention and intention towards your ads and you'll make more money\nI'm sure you wouldn't delegate your number one revenue generating action to a VA or some AI right?\nGreat.\nIf you have to use AI, give it a lot of context on what's worked and what hasn't.\nThat's the ONLY way you get good outputs from AI.",
